{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Brew is a 3D action platformer with an arcade feel. Risk death as you dodge and dash to the safety of the next MoonDucks coffee shop. Activate traps that cause blood and feathers. Test your reflexes to avoid the relentless zombie onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/bec50826304b37a5af77c2f62e7ad516.poster.avif?t=1759507107\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/bec50826304b37a5af77c2f62e7ad516.webp?t=1759507107\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=247 /></picture></span><br><strong>RUN FROM THE DECAFFEINATED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop or throw coffee beans to lure and trick zombie hordes. Be clever. To top the leaderboard, Joe must take risks to orchestrate mass murders for monster point totals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/4d74d9f71a2adc029895e1631a4d0f7b.poster.avif?t=1759507107\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/4d74d9f71a2adc029895e1631a4d0f7b.webm?t=1759507107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/4d74d9f71a2adc029895e1631a4d0f7b.mp4?t=1759507107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL \u2018EM ALL, IF YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to always be chased and harassed. Swat through the chaos, leap from tall buildings, and make good use of environmental hazards. Save yourself to take the fight to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/732235bc48cd66af935429bcfe4e299f.poster.avif?t=1759507107\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/732235bc48cd66af935429bcfe4e299f.webp?t=1759507107\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=247 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Brew is awash in atmospherics and cinematic moments. Find yourself behind the DJ booth at a warehouse rave, or atop a monorail screaming out of control, or summiting the nuclear cooling tower. Drink it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/635163b739c58449fcd7b3caff79a654.poster.avif?t=1759507107\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/635163b739c58449fcd7b3caff79a654.webp?t=1759507107\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=247 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEEL FREE TO REPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek different paths to unlock secrets, like fabulous additional costumes.\u00a0 Switch to the '68 Living Dead Mode to experience this apocalypse in black-and-white.<br><br>It was the end of civilization and there was no coffee. <br>There was no coffee and it was the end of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499670?t=1759507107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/379a8185a0e39678578885d76bd2c50470727ec8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759507107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_